         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>Describes circuit design elements used in the Vivado Design Suite and associated with the Xilinx 7 series architectures. Element details include VHDL and Verilog instantiation code, schematic symbols, truth tables, and other information specific to the design element.</rdf:li>
